FastMoE master 55af4f9 (2025-02-10), the changes the FasterMoE arms of the
MoE example's tables ran with (ref/README.md, "FastMoE and FasterMoE"):

  - cuda/fastermoe/smart_schedule.cpp: the smart-schedule backward's dtype
    dispatch covers bf16 (the forward's already did);
  - fmoe/fastermoe/shadow_policy.py: the shadow policy sums the gathered
    token counts over the source ranks for each expert (shipped: over the
    experts for each source rank, so nothing was ever shadowed with one
    expert per rank);
  - setup.py: NCCL_LIBDIR names the directory of the NCCL library to link,
    for an environment that ships libnccl.so.2 without a libnccl.so link.

Apply in the clone with `git apply fastmoe-55af4f9.patch`; build_fastmoe.sh
does the clone, the patch and the build.

